@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+| Class | methods IMPLEMENTED (names) | vanilla file:lines read | BLOCKED with grep evidence |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Ingredient |  | `net/minecraft/world/item/crafting/Ingredient.java:25-117` | `acceptsItem`/`display`/`optionalIngredientToDisplay`/`testOptionalIngredient`: `rg -n '\\b(acceptsItem|display|optionalIngredientToDisplay|testOptionalIngredient)\\b' crates/pumpkin-plugin-api/src crates/pumpkin/src crates/pumpkin-protocol/src` had no matching implementation; plugin `Ingredient` is the existing `Item`/`Tag`/`OneOf` data model. `equals`/`hashCode`: `#[derive(PartialEq, Eq, Hash)]` in `crates/pumpkin-plugin-api/src/recipe.rs:90`. |
+| TurtleEggBlock | `playerDestroy` via the live `broken` hook, using the captured pre-removal state | `net/minecraft/world/level/block/TurtleEggBlock.java:56-62, 65-92, 94-127, 141-152, 173-183` | none |
+| ClientboundChunksBiomesPacket |  | `net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/ClientboundChunksBiomesPacket.java:14-85` | `forChunks`/`extractChunkData`: `rg -n '\\b(forChunks|extractChunkData)\\b' crates/pumpkin crates/pumpkin-protocol --glob '*.rs'` had no live caller; `rg -n '\\b(LevelChunk|LevelChunkSection|biomes\\(\\)\\.write)\\b' crates/pumpkin crates/pumpkin-protocol --glob '*.rs'` had no supporting server-side source. `getReadBuffer`: client-only read helper; `rg -n '\\b(getReadBuffer|ClientGamePacketListener|handleChunksBiomes)\\b' crates/pumpkin crates/pumpkin-protocol --glob '*.rs'` had no client-side implementation. `ChunkBiomeData` is represented by the existing `ChunkBiomeEntry`; `type` is generated by `#[java_packet(CHUNKS_BIOMES)]`. |
+| LightBlock |  | `net/minecraft/world/level/block/LightBlock.java:31-36, 43-63, 65-115` | `createBlockStateDefinition`: generated `LightLikeProperties` in `crates/pumpkin-data/src/generated/block.rs:658777-658888`; `getRenderShape`/`getShadeBrightness`: client rendering only, with no server rendering hook (`rg -n '\\b(getRenderShape|getShadeBrightness)\\b' crates/pumpkin/src crates/pumpkin-protocol/src --glob '*.rs'` had no implementation); `setLightOnStack` is inlined by `get_clone_item_stack`; `useWithoutItem` is renamed to the live `normal_use` hook. |
+| ServerboundSetStructureBlockPacket |  | `net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/ServerboundSetStructureBlockPacket.java:20-91, 133-181` | `getUpdateType` is inlined by live `handle_set_structure_block`, which matches `packet.action` against `ACTION_*`; `isShowAir`/`isShowBoundingBox`/`isStrict` are the existing `show_air`/`show_bounding_box`/`strict` flag accessors; `type` is generated by `#[java_packet(SET_STRUCTURE_BLOCK)]`. `rg -n '\\b(getUpdateType|isShowAir|isShowBoundingBox|isStrict)\\b' crates/pumpkin-protocol/src crates/pumpkin/src --glob '*.rs'` had no duplicate Java-named implementation. |
