I found one reachable parity defect inside the already-wired SpawnEgg paths: vanilla emits `ENTITY_PLACE` for successful egg spawns, `BLOCK_CHANGE` for spawner retargeting, and awards the item-used stat for liquid spawning; Pumpkin currently performs the mutations but omits those notifications. I’m wiring those existing call sites now, with no new public API.
